1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:03,717
The golden Lanka was not built by Ravan.

2
00:00:03,717 --> 00:00:05,170
He had snatched it...

3
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:07,720
from his own brother.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,007
In the previous story,

5
00:00:10,007 --> 00:00:13,300
many believe Shiva built Lanka and gave it to Rishi Vishrava.

6
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:18,851
But what does the Valmiki Ramayana say?

7
00:00:18,851 --> 00:00:19,250
Listen.

8
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:23,681
The Uttara Kanda of Valmiki Ramayana says,

9
00:00:23,681 --> 00:00:26,510
amidst the ocean, upon Mount Trikuta,

10
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,940
this city was created by divine architect Vishwakarma.

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,669
Meaning neither did Shiva build it,

12
00:00:32,669 --> 00:00:33,500
nor did Ravan.

13
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,624
First, demons Mali, Sumali,

14
00:00:36,624 --> 00:00:38,610
and Malyavan dwelt here.

15
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:42,206
Then a war with Lord Vishnu began,

16
00:00:42,206 --> 00:00:43,263
Mali was slain,

17
00:00:43,263 --> 00:00:45,800
and the rest fled to the underworld.

18
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:47,650
And Lanka was deserted.

19
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,650
Then came Kuber, son of Rishi Vishrava.

20
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:55,119
Pleased by his penance,

21
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:57,294
Brahma made him the lord of wealth,

22
00:00:57,294 --> 00:00:59,220
and gifted the Pushpaka Vimana.

23
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:02,130
[Brahma] "Son, settle in Lanka,

24
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,420
[Brahma] that city awaits you."

25
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:07,560
The golden Lanka found its king.

26
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,510
Yet a demon sitting in the netherworld watched all this,

27
00:01:15,090 --> 00:01:15,590
Sumali.

28
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:19,630
He sent his daughter Kaikesi to Vishrava.

29
00:01:19,630 --> 00:01:21,160
And born was Dashanan.

30
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:27,830
Fierce penance, Brahma's boon, and then,

31
00:01:29,370 --> 00:01:30,770
a message sent to Kuber.

32
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:34,488
[Ravan] "Lanka belonged to the demons,

33
00:01:34,488 --> 00:01:36,210
Lanka belongs to the demons.

34
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,610
[Ravan] Return it!"

35
00:01:39,730 --> 00:01:41,130
Kuber went to his father.

36
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:47,129
[Vishrava] "The boon has blinded him,

37
00:01:47,129 --> 00:01:49,367
my son. Do not fight him. Leave Lanka,

38
00:01:49,367 --> 00:01:50,780
and depart for Kailash."

39
00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:53,360
And Kuber,

40
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,810
without shooting a single arrow,

41
00:01:56,270 --> 00:01:56,910
departed.

42
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,690
Ravan got Lanka,

43
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:03,350
not by building it, but by snatching it.

44
00:02:03,830 --> 00:02:05,230
The walls were of gold,

45
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:09,390
yet at its foundation,

46
00:02:10,490 --> 00:02:12,690
lay a home abandoned by a brother.

47
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:17,710
And what is stolen never lasts.

48
00:02:17,710 --> 00:02:20,080
That very Lanka was burned one day.

